      "id": "p0111-b002",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "The phrase \"Oira Shock\" was mostly a joke name that went viral - genuine \"shock\" events in Japanese include the \"Lehman Shock\" (the 2008 global financial crisis) and the \"Corona Shock\" (the rise of the 2020 coronavirus pandemic)",
